paper/sections/3_method.tex:43:    \item[\textbf{AnomalyVFM}~\citep{anomalyvfm2025}.] Vision foundation model adapted via LoRA for zero-shot anomaly segmentation, with a convolutional decoder. We use the DINOv2 backbone variant; provides image-level score plus pixel mask. Complementary to SubspaceAD on infrastructure (calibration AUROC $0.72$ on D4 vs SubspaceAD's $0.50$) and on MVTec-LOCO logical anomalies where its synthetic-anomaly training data covers compositional defects.
